<title>SWEDEN: Average yield 7.92 pct Swedish 11-yr bond auction.</title>
<headline>Average yield 7.92 pct Swedish 11-yr bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted yield on an auction of 11-year bonds was 7.92 percent, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The debt office initially announced an auction of 11-year bond worth 3.0 billion crowns but reduced the issue to 2.8 billion crowns.</p>
<p>Bids totalling 2.94 billion crowns were received.</p>
<p>					    Loan 1037</p>
<p> Volume issued (millions)		2.80</p>
<p> Total bids    (millions)		2.94</p>
<p> Number of accepted bids		50</p>
<p> Number of bids			   55</p>
<p> Lowest yields			     7.90</p>
<p> Highest yields			    7.94</p>
<p> Weighted average yield		  7.92</p>
<p>--  Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
